608
40:17.502 --> 40:20.762
Oh, yes! Then you should go.

609
40:20.762 --> 40:22.727
I'll go first.

610
40:35.041 --> 40:37.367
If only the bench had been okay!

611
41:11.678 --> 41:13.994
Oh, Sera!

612
41:13.994 --> 41:15.786
Buy me a drink!

613
41:15.786 --> 41:18.390
Yeon Su, sorry. I'm a bit busy!

614
41:18.390 --> 41:21.152
Ah, don't! Don't!

615
41:23.130 --> 41:25.286
Oh, sorry, order room service!

616
41:25.286 --> 41:27.314
Get the expensive wine, I'll treat you!

617
41:27.314 --> 41:29.252
Okay.

618
42:04.462 --> 42:06.171
Do you want some?

619
42:13.842 --> 42:16.658
But why are you alone?

620
42:20.226 --> 42:24.434
We just had dinner and went our separate ways.

621
42:27.250 --> 42:29.136
Yeah.

622
42:32.230 --> 42:34.358
You said you had dinner.

623
42:35.790 --> 42:39.463
This is dessert.

624
42:57.370 --> 43:02.261
I don't think you need to change rooms.

625
43:02.962 --> 43:04.930
You have a lot of luggage.

626
43:04.930 --> 43:07.308
Well, it's fine. For me.

627
43:08.774 --> 43:10.630
Okay.

628
44:05.206 --> 44:09.294
What I like?

629
44:51.802 --> 44:53.666
What?

630
46:33.922 --> 46:35.808
Who is it?

631
46:38.558 --> 46:39.802
Who is it?

632
46:39.802 --> 46:42.886
Yeon Su, it's me.

633
46:42.886 --> 46:44.900
Seung Jun?

634
46:47.442 --> 46:49.430
Surprise!

635
46:50.922 --> 46:52.494
What? At this hour?

636
46:52.494 --> 46:54.042
Come on!

637
46:54.042 --> 46:56.254
I came because I have something to tell you.

638
46:57.211 --> 47:00.454
It's late. Tell me tomorrow.

639
47:00.454 --> 47:02.866
Hey, wait, wait, wait!

640
47:02.866 --> 47:05.078
Today! It has to be today!

641
47:05.078 --> 47:09.954
Right now, while I still have the courage.

642
47:09.954 --> 47:11.098
- What's wrong with you? - Come on.

643
47:11.098 --> 47:13.930
I really need to tell you something.

644
47:13.930 --> 47:17.600
Can't you just open the door for a second?

645
47:18.518 --> 47:20.342
Just a second.

646
47:23.110 --> 47:24.991
Move your foot.

647
47:28.622 --> 47:29.730
What is it?

648
47:29.730 --> 47:31.838
Yeon Su.

649
47:31.838 --> 47:34.450
Let me ask you one thing first.

650
47:36.194 --> 47:38.262
Do you still have feelings for me?

651
47:38.262 --> 47:40.118
Ugh, here we go again...

652
47:40.118 --> 47:42.418
Hey, it's not like that.

653
47:42.418 --> 47:44.242
If our companies work together,

654
47:44.242 --> 47:45.654
we'll be seeing each other all the time,

655
47:45.654 --> 47:49.946
and this is really, really important to me.

656
47:49.946 --> 47:51.190
Just give me an answer.

657
47:51.190 --> 47:55.614
None. I don't feel a single thing for you. Happy? You can leave now.

658
47:55.614 --> 47:58.346
- Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait! - Hey! Stop!

659
47:58.346 --> 48:01.958
- Wait, just hold on a second. - Come on, what's wrong with you?

660
48:05.710 --> 48:08.454
I really loved you.

661
48:11.058 --> 48:12.729
So...

662
48:13.423 --> 48:15.824
I wanted to apologize.

663
48:16.542 --> 48:19.622
The way I treated you up until now...

664
48:19.622 --> 48:22.706
I'm really sorry for all of it.

665
48:27.378 --> 48:28.542
Yeon Su...

666
48:28.542 --> 48:30.350
- Let go. - Wait...

667
48:30.350 --> 48:32.067
I said, let go!

668
48:32.067 --> 48:33.546
Let go of me!

669
48:33.546 --> 48:35.719
I'm getting married!

670
48:37.394 --> 48:39.190
What?

671
48:39.190 --> 48:41.406
You're what?

672
48:41.406 --> 48:43.578
I'm...

673
48:43.578 --> 48:45.521
going to be a dad.

674
48:46.882 --> 48:48.538
That's what happened.

675
48:48.538 --> 48:51.410
Surprised, right? I was shocked too.

676
48:51.410 --> 48:54.642
People always say there's someone you're meant to marry,

677
48:54.642 --> 48:56.474
and it turns out to be true.

678
48:56.474 --> 48:58.858
What we couldn't do in a year and a half,

679
48:58.858 --> 49:02.454
who knew I'd do with someone I've only known for two months?

680
49:03.222 --> 49:05.499
The crazy thing is,

681
49:06.346 --> 49:09.253
I just feel so sure about her.

682
49:10.986 --> 49:12.170
Sure?

683
49:12.170 --> 49:14.186
Yeah.

684
49:14.186 --> 49:16.779
I know it's shameless of me,

685
49:16.779 --> 49:19.388
but I really hope you'll congratulate me.

686
50:12.882 --> 50:15.986
- Yes. - Are you okay?

687
50:23.314 --> 50:28.332
I'm sorry. Did I wake you up?

688
50:29.214 --> 50:31.126
I asked if you're okay.

689
50:32.030 --> 50:35.547
You heard everything, didn't you?

690
50:40.158 --> 50:42.870
Of course, I am.

691
50:42.870 --> 50:46.942
It's just... how should I put it?

692
50:49.002 --> 50:51.021
It's kind of funny.

693
50:52.194 --> 50:55.009
Thinking that a year and a half

694
50:55.009 --> 50:57.822
lost to two months,

695
50:57.822 --> 51:01.281
it's kind of a reality check.

696
51:03.446 --> 51:05.730
The only difference

697
51:05.730 --> 51:07.754
is that we didn't sleep together.

698
51:07.754 --> 51:09.790
That's literally the only thing.

699
51:10.494 --> 51:15.002
Do you regret not sleeping with him?

700
51:15.002 --> 51:16.890
No.

701
51:16.890 --> 51:19.358
But strangely...

702
51:21.274 --> 51:25.681
I think I finally understand how he felt.

703
51:29.598 --> 51:34.078
Even though I dated him for a year and a half,

704
51:34.078 --> 51:38.110
I never once wanted to sleep with him.

705
51:39.166 --> 51:40.971
Yet,

706
51:44.774 --> 51:48.454
I keep thinking about the kiss with you,

707
51:48.454 --> 51:50.414
after barely two months.

708
51:57.062 --> 51:59.446
So...

709
51:59.446 --> 52:02.985
I think I'm going to be honest now.
